</div></div></section><section id="text-2" class="widget widget_text"><h2 class="widget-title">Class Action Defense</h2>			<div class="textwidget"><p>Insights on the defense of class actions, including workplace and employment claims, consumer fraud/protection, shareholder and derivative suits, and the many other issues faced by employers, financial institutions, insurers and corporations, from some of the nation’s most experienced attorneys in defending class action claims.</p>
</div>
